			<param index="1" name="owner" type="Object" />
			<description>
				Binds [param owner] as the object this slot reads declared input onto and captures declared state from, and answers whether the slot exists.
				The slot holds an id rather than a pointer and resolves it at each property-I/O moment, because the simulate step between them is arbitrary user code and may free the object. Binding is optional: a slot driven by [method set_state] alone never binds and touches no property.
			</description>
		</method>
