			<description>
				The wire bytes of [param payload]'s declared state fields, in declaration order. The bytes that ship are the bytes that hash, so a fingerprint taken here and one taken by a peer decoding the frame describe the same values. Two payloads are comparable exactly when they name the same fields.
			</description>
